        "original_id": "918e6b11-3ed4-5a97-9b70-874d42fcb45f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Freederm\n- Companies: Diomed Developments Limited\n- Concepts: Nicotinamide, niacinamide\n- Topics: Acne medication, skin care medication, dietary supplements\n\nFacts:\n- Freederm is a UK brand of acne and skin care medication manufactured by Diomed Developments Limited.\n- Freederm products include nicotinamide as an active ingredient.\n- Diomed Developments Limited claims that nicotinamide is clinically proven to help get rid of inflamed red spots.\n- Nicotinamide, also known as niacinamide and NAA, is a vitamin found in food.\n- Nicotinamide is used as a dietary supplement and as a medication.",
